---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Built" description="LifeLens and ApplyReady are working products built by Darshan Kansara around private intelligence, visible evidence, and human control.">
  <header class="built-hero"><p class="code">Built / working products</p><div><h1>I still build.</h1><p>Operating large systems can make technology abstract. Building from zero brings the constraints back: one person, one interface, one decision that has to work.</p></div></header>

  <section class="build-principle"><p>Different problems.</p><span aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>Evidence before action.</strong><span aria-hidden="true"></span><p>The person keeps control.</p></section>

  <div class="products">
    <article class="product lifelens">
      <div class="product-index"><span>01</span><small>Android · live</small></div>
      <div class="visual phones"><img src="/lifelens/screen-1.png" alt="LifeLens home screen showing a private photo library" width="1080" height="1920" /><img src="/lifelens/screen-2.png" alt="LifeLens showing storage analysis in plain language" width="1080" height="1920" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="copy"><div class="name"><img src="/lifelens/icon.png" alt="" width="54" height="54" /><h2>LifeLens</h2></div><p class="thesis">Understand photo clutter without uploading the library or automating the irreversible decision.</p><dl><div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>An endless camera roll hides duplicates, clutter, and the memories worth protecting.</dd></div><div><dt>Product</dt><dd>Private, on-device photo intelligence with focused review groups and natural-language questions.</dd></div><div><dt>Boundary</dt><dd>Uncertain means protect. Similar remains review-only. Android confirms deletion.</dd></div></dl><div class="actions"><a href="/lifelens">Read the product story →</a><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.darshankansara.lifelens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play ↗</a></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="product applyready">
      <div class="product-index"><span>02</span><small>Web · live</small></div>
      <div class="visual fit"><img src="/applyready/fit.png" alt="ApplyReady comparing a generic application with evidence-led role fit" width="1200" height="1200" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="copy"><div class="name"><i aria-hidden="true">AR</i><h2>ApplyReady</h2></div><p class="thesis">Decide whether the experience supports the role before rewriting the application.</p><dl><div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Most job tools optimize language before testing whether the underlying evidence is there.</dd></div><div><dt>Product</dt><dd>Deterministic browser-side role analysis, honest gaps, and editable application material.</dd></div><div><dt>Boundary</dt><dd>No invented experience, no account gate, no stored resume text, no outcome guarantee.</dd></div></dl><div class="actions"><a href="/applyready">Read the product story →</a><a href="https://applyready.darshankansara.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open product ↗</a></div></div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <section class="built-close"><p class="code">The operator in the builder</p><h2>A product is another operating system: inputs, evidence, boundaries, decisions, consequences.</h2><a href="/ai">See where applied AI fits →</a></section>

  <style>
    :global(body),:global(main){background:var(--ink);color:var(--text)}.code,.product-index,.copy dt,.visual::after{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.code{color:var(--gold)}.built-hero,.build-principle,.products,.built-close>*{width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 2 * var(--pad)));margin-inline:auto}.built-hero{min-height:calc(68svh - 100px);padding-block:var(--section);display:grid;grid-template-columns:var(--rail) 1fr;gap:var(--gutter);align-items:end;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.built-hero h1{color:var(--paper);font-size:clamp(3.4rem,5.5vw,5.5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:.96}.built-hero div>p{max-width:58ch;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem}.build-principle{min-height:108px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto 1fr auto;gap:20px;align-items:center;color:var(--dim);font: .64rem var(--font-mono);text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.build-principle span{height:1px;background:var(--line)}.build-principle strong{color:var(--gold);font-weight:500}.build-principle p{margin:0}.product{display:grid;grid-template-columns:var(--rail) minmax(300px,.92fr) 1.08fr;gap:var(--gutter);padding:clamp(72px,9vw,118px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.product-index{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;color:var(--dim)}.product-index span{color:var(--gold)}.visual{position:relative;min-height:570px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line)}.phones{background:linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(77,154,235,.13),rgba(198,161,90,.05))}.phones img{position:absolute;width:52%;height:auto;box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,.42)}.phones img:first-child{left:5%;top:12%}.phones img:last-child{right:4%;top:25%}.fit{display:grid;place-items:center;padding:28px;background:var(--paper)}.fit img{width:100%;height:auto;box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(8,17,31,.2)}.copy{align-self:center}.name{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:17px}.name img,.name i{width:54px;height:54px}.name img{border-radius:8px}.name i{display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:normal .7rem var(--font-mono)}.name h2,.built-close h2{margin:0;color:var(--paper);font-size:clamp(2.7rem,4.7vw,4.5rem);font-weight:400}.thesis{margin:27px 0;color:var(--azure-bright);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.65rem);line-height:1.38}.copy dl{margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.copy dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:92px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.copy dt{color:var(--gold)}.copy dd{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.83rem}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:22px;margin-top:28px}.actions a{color:var(--azure-bright);font-size:.84rem}.actions a:first-child{color:var(--paper)}.built-close{padding-block:var(--section);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.built-close h2{max-width:19ch;margin-top:26px}.built-close a{display:inline-flex;margin-top:24px;color:var(--azure-bright)}
    @media(max-width:1000px){.product{grid-template-columns:110px 1fr}.visual,.copy{grid-column:2}.visual{min-height:500px}.copy{padding-top:16px}}@media(max-width:650px){.built-hero{min-height:auto;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.built-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,13vw,3.8rem)}.build-principle{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:9px;padding-block:22px}.build-principle span{display:none}.product{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.visual,.copy{grid-column:auto}.product-index{flex-direction:row}.visual{min-height:450px}.copy dl div{grid-template-columns:80px 1fr}}
  </style>
</Base>
